        "original_id": "8e458907-9a54-5103-8bea-f2dadd80385e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Marley Shelton, David M. Evans\n- Films: Grand Canyon, The Sandlot, Pleasantville, Never Been Kissed, Sugar & Spice, Valentine\n- Topics: film debut, teen films, coming-of-age baseball film\n\nFacts:\n- Marley Shelton made her film debut in Grand Canyon in 1991.\n- The Sandlot is a 1993 American coming-of-age baseball film about a group of young baseball players during the summer of 1962.\n- The Sandlot was co-written and directed by David M. Evans.\n- Marley Shelton appeared in The Sandlot in 1993.\n- Marley Shelton later appeared in Pleasantville in 1998 and Never Been Kissed in 1999.\n- Marley Shelton appeared in Sugar & Spice and Valentine in 2001.\n- Several of Marley Shelton’s early film roles were in films aimed at teenage audiences.",
